{
 "_about": "The notebook (Sổ tay, #8, src/core/notebook.js): a collection of prints that fills in as the child plays. kinds: the order of the pages. entries: the legends, the creatures, and the places, each with its title (titleKey), its print (look: a look of data/figures.json, drawn with portraitCanvas; a place has the print of a place), and met: the thing that fills it in. met is a key of profile.notebook.seen (talk:<dialogue>: the child heard the talk; creature:<kind>: an animal of the kind came near the hero, or an enemy of the kind came in a raid; map:<id>: the hero was on the map) or flag:<flag> (a story flag). The skills come from data/skills.json (the skills of the era of the story up to one grade over the grade of the child): a skill is met after its first skill event in the world, and a mastered skill has a red seal.",
